      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The Core Architectural Differences**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| Aspect | Client's Framework | Your Refactor |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| --- | --- | --- |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Scroll Engine** | Custom IntersectionObserver + CSS vars | Locomotive Scroll (industry standard) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Data Flow** | Component watchers + state | Pinia store orchestration (unidirectional) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Story Format** | TypeScript scene configs | JSON/YAML (CMS-ready) |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Components** | Mount/unmount per scene | Persistent block components |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Animations** | Component-defined GSAP | GSAP with persistent timelines |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **Layout System** | Split/Immersive switch | Rich split ratios + gaps |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "| **DX** | TypeScript imports | JSON configs + type safety |"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
