    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**What Your Refactor Actually Solves**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Looking at your scroll-architecture.md, you've documented the **exact problem** you're feeling:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The Circular Dependency Issue:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User scrolls → Locomotive → Store updates → Components watch →"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Components call scrollTo → Locomotive animates → FEEDBACK LOOP ❌"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Your Solution:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Scroll Store = Single Source of Truth"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Intent vs Observation pattern"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Components are read-only listeners"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Idempotent actions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
