      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> \"I've been working with the autumn-stories framework and identified some architectural patterns that could unlock more sophisticated storytelling capabilities. I've prototyped a complementary approach that preserves what's working while addressing some constraints I've been feeling."
