    {
      "id": "b-155",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The Partnership Angle**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-156",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your refactor represents **substantial architectural thinking**. This isn't freelance work—this is **co-founding level contribution**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-157",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Position It As:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-158",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> \"I've realized I'm not just implementing features—I'm rethinking the storytelling platform itself. The framework I've built could power:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-159",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-160",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - **Easier client onboarding** (JSON configs non-developers can edit)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-161",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - **Faster story production** (block library + reusable patterns)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-162",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - **CMS integration** (story configs as database records)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-163",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - **Richer interactions** (scroll-synced video, audio, complex choreography)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-164",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> - **Better mobile experience** (Locomotive's mobile optimizations)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-165",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-166",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> If this aligns with where you want to take the business, I'd love to discuss a more formal partnership where I own the technical platform evolution while you focus on client relationships and business development.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-167",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-168",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-169",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Critical Considerations**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-170",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Acknowledge His Investment**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-171",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "His framework represents months/years of work. Don't diminish it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-172",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Show Compatibility**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-173",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your approach doesn't replace—it extends. Both can coexist."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-174",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Focus on Outcomes**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-175",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"This lets us take on more complex clients\" vs \"My code is better\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-176",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Be Honest About Trade-offs**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-179",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-177",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Your approach: More complex setup, learning curve for his patterns"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-178",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "His approach: Proven, production-tested, client-approved"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-180",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5. Frame as Collaboration**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-181",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"What would it take to get your feedback on this?\" not \"You should switch\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-182",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
